@host = http://localhost:8080

### Weather question answered via the MCP server's currentWeather tool
POST {{host}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the weather in Lviv, Ukraine? When are sunrise and sunset?"
}

### Tools the MCP server publishes (tools/list)
GET {{host}}/tools

### Resources the MCP server publishes (resources/list) - 501: LangChain4j's server has no resources
GET {{host}}/resources

### Question answered from an MCP resource (resources/read) - 501: LangChain4j's server has no resources
POST {{host}}/resources/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uri": "movies://Avatar",
  "question": "Who directed this movie?"
}

### Prompts the MCP server publishes (prompts/list) - 501: LangChain4j's server has no prompts
GET {{host}}/prompts

### Run a server-side prompt (prompts/get) - 501: LangChain4j's server has no prompts
POST {{host}}/prompts/weather-report
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Lviv",
  "country": "Ukraine"
}
